#: src/app/device/review.rs:432
msgid "{n} track has different cues or grid on {} than in your collection. Nothing was changed: neither copy wins by itself. KEEP MINE writes your collection's copy to the device, TAKE THE STICK'S copies the device's into your collection; UNDO stays available for both."
